{"Time":"2026-09-30T03:30:23.5940018+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"W04_ASSERTION {\"actual\":[true,4,0,\"DRAFT\"],\"assertion_id\":\"A01-01\",\"evidence\":{\"goal\":{\"acceptance_contract\":{\"checks\":[{\"check_id\":\"C01\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"目标、未完成任务ID、有效决定revision全部一致。\\n旧决定只可作为历史显示；不会恢复为生效决定；向用户索取已存在材料次数为0。\\nContextBundle包含原始记录引用及快照hash，能回查每个引用。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C02\",\"command_key\":\"test.security\",\"expected\":\"所有A的响应/日志/ContextBundle不含B的秘密标记；越权请求不返回B正文。\\n通用知识可读且保留来源、授权范围、版本；共享不扩大为B全项目权限。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C03\",\"command_key\":\"test.domain\",\"expected\":\"T1为NEEDS_REVALIDATION，A1为STALE；集合恰为两"}
{"Time":"2026-09-30T03:30:23.5940018+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"个受影响对象。\\nT2可继续且不因本次变更进入NEEDS_REVALIDATION。\\n旧结果可封存为历史，但不能成为current或ACCEPTED；过期If-Match写入返回412，状态不兼容提交返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C04\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"只有一个同revision写入成功；另一请求412且不覆盖；整合后恰有一个当前生效决定。\\n相同事件ID最多产生一次业务副作用；缺前序事件先补取/等待，不倒退状态。\\n相同幂等键/相同请求重放原结果；同键不同请求返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C05\",\"command_key\":\"test.experiments\",\"expected\":\"本轮COMPLETE，必需来源/实验均已完成且游标已保存；负结果不被标为执行错误。\\nADOPT数量为0，项目实现版本不变；结论保留证"}
{"Time":"2026-09-30T03:30:23.5940018+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"据和原因，不声称功能/质量已提升。\\nWATCH/INCONCLUSIVE有明确缺口及复查触发；重要排除可形成里程碑，普通空轮不强制通知。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C06\",\"command_key\":\"test.research.fixture\",\"expected\":\"GitHub/论文继续且保存回执、时间窗口和游标；不因X失败全部中止。\\n必需X未完成时周期为PARTIAL；仅当无任何实质工作可推进才BLOCKED；界面不得称全面扫描或COMPLETE。\\n429遵守Retry-After，不形成忙重试；缺配置生成去重ResourceRequest，覆盖缺口不被隐藏。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C07\",\"command_key\":\"test.jev.fixture\",\"expected\":\"三种子场景全部拒绝ACCEPTED/ADOPT；高分不修改必需测试结果。\\nDecisionReceipt同时保留高分、模型版本、反证、失败检查与拒绝原因"}
